<title>JAPAN: Reuters average April Tapis assessed at $21.08.</title>
<headline>Reuters average April Tapis assessed at $21.08.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for April was $21.08 per barrel.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>	  April1  $22.13  11  $21.20  22  $20.40</p>
<p>		 2  $21.85  14  $21.20  23  $20.65</p>
<p>		 3  $21.85  15  $21.20  24  $20.65</p>
<p>		 4  $21.65  16  $21.05  25  $20.40</p>
<p>		 7  $21.40  17  $21.05  28  $20.60</p>
<p>		 8  $21.25  18  $21.05  29  $20.60</p>
<p>		 9  $21.05  21  $20.75  30  $20.53</p>
<p>		10  $21.20</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk +81-3-3432-8837</p>
